abstract: >-
  A research simulator in which physical content is expressed as configured
  disturbances on a three-dimensional lattice with six-neighbor causal links,
  bounded integer arithmetic and explicit local conservation checks. Field
  laws, transport candidates and quantum event programs are supplied by
  initialization data rather than inferred from physical names.
